FerrumChem reimplements algorithms, parameter tables and data from the
following projects in order to reproduce their results exactly. Their
copyright notices and license terms are reproduced below.

- The Chemistry Development Kit (CDK), LGPL-2.1-or-later, https://cdk.github.io
  CDK descriptor ports (Chi indices, PubChem fingerprint and its key tables,
  Gasteiger-Marsili charges, polarizability, BCUT, autocorrelation, WTPT, MDE,
  ring, chain, carbon-type and acid/base group descriptors, CDK aromaticity and
  atom typing). CDK's license is the same as FerrumChem's (see LICENSE).

- RDKit, BSD 3-Clause, https://www.rdkit.org
  Sanitization, stereo/CIP perception, descriptor and fingerprint algorithms,
  element and isotope data, Crippen and fragment tables.

- Mordred, BSD 3-Clause, https://github.com/mordred-descriptor/mordred
  Atomic property tables and the ATS / BCUT / topological index definitions.

- Biosynfoni, MIT, https://github.com/lucinamay/biosynfoni
  Substructure (SMARTS) definitions of the Biosynfoni fingerprint.

